# Derived by hand from Jimmy's ruling of 5 November 2026 (`@Distinct`) and Semantics ch. 7 (R3): `$d` is 5 at the build; a write of 5 fires `$n`'s update and not `$d`'s; each change fires both.
test refires_only_on_change

